>> Animal := Objekt nĳ.
>> Factory := Objekt nĳ.

Animal by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: {
	>> animal := sels nĳ.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal by: ['sound:'] dwaan: { :s
	eigen sound := s.
}.

Animal by: ['sound'] dwaan: { <- eigen sound.
}.

>> Dog := Objekt nĳ.
>> Cat := Objekt nĳ.

Dog by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: { <- Animal nĳ sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: { <- Animal nĳ sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Utfier skriuwe: Dog nĳ sound, nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: Cat nĳ sound, nije-rigel.

Factory by: ['mix:and:'] dwaan: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal nĳ sound: (
		( beast1 sound fan: 0 lingte: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound fan: 2 lingte: 5 )
	).
}.

Utfier skriuwe: (Factory mix: Dog nĳ and: Cat nĳ) sound, nije-rigel.
